# Copy to `.env` for local development of Reticle itself.
#
# `.env` is gitignored, so it only exists on the machine that created it. The committed guarantee
# that our own development never reports telemetry is `isReticleSourceCheckout` (see
# packages/server/src/telemetry/dev-repo.ts), which detects this monorepo by its root package name.
# This file is the convenient, explicit belt to that structural braces — and it documents the knob
# for anyone who wants it in their OWN project's .env.

# Disable anonymous usage telemetry. Also honours the cross-tool DO_NOT_TRACK convention.
RETICLE_TELEMETRY=0
